      "id": "claim_3cddfa2821bf4377a14849eaf501f453",
      "statement": "buildCoachCheckInReport() in src/lib/coach-check-in.ts is a pure function: given sessions, working sets, program days/slots/phases, the exercise catalog, and bodyweight context, it returns only facts and classifications, never programming recommendations, and never mutates training data.",
