      "id": "claim_6614eb787fe543cc9586e18e92039833",
      "statement": "The CoachCheckInReport uses America/Chicago as the default reporting timezone; the current window is the seven calendar dates ending on generatedAt, the prior window is the immediately preceding seven dates, the two never overlap, sessions are windowed by performed_at excluding future sessions, and only sessions with finished_at contribute to execution metrics (open sessions become a data-quality warning).",
