      "statement": "buildCoachRecommendations() in src/lib/coach-recommendations.ts is a deterministic layer, kept separate from coach-check-in.ts, that consumes the canonical report plus the same raw rows, delegates normal overload to sessionTarget(), and never mutates a program, slot, set, or session.",
