    {
      "id": "claim_a830d1c34e9443ec983b61c7c8957316",
      "statement": "The AI Coach agent described in docs/AI-COACH.md is specified (2026-09-20) but has no implementation yet; it is locked to wrap rather than replace Track Coach, use LangChain TypeScript in-process (no separate Python service), keep the engine as sole owner of numbers/prescriptions with the agent owning only language/intake/drafts/navigation, and defer all writes past Slice 0 (drafts in Slice 2, confirm-chip startNextSession possibly in Slice 1, live mutations only in Slice 4).",
